:: ArgueThakur
<h2 class="story-title">The Thakur's Transformation</h2>

"The thakur was MOST true!" the storyteller declares. "To recognize dharma in that very moment—that takes immense strength!"

The necklace agrees: "Yes! The thakur's transformation was divine!"

"Though one could argue the thief defied his nature, or the seth showed rare forgiveness..."

The voices clash and debate...

